                      "id": "tJNkD",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$mutedFg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 点击「进行中」已关联卡片直接跳转并聚焦对应 Agent 窗格（而不是弹编辑框打断心流）。\n• 查看/编辑 Prompt、发送追问均在右侧面板内切换子视图（← 返回看板），始终保持中间终端 100% 可见。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Bpg8n",
                  "name": "Note / 视觉克制，只突出需要人介入的任务",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "children": [
