                      "content": "视觉克制，只突出需要人介入的任务",
                      "lineHeight": 1.43,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pfbo2",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$mutedFg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 去掉刺眼的整框彩色描边与双重按钮描边，改用柔和的左侧 3px 语义指示条（仅等待输入/待确认/失败）+ 无边框语义胶囊。\n• 已完成任务默认折叠，展开时为轻量单行列表；泳道标题对齐侧边栏风格。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "XxrHY",
                  "name": "Note / 待确认门禁 & 自动恢复",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "uJ7hl",
                      "name": "Heading",
                      "fill": "$fg",
                      "content": "待确认门禁 & 自动恢复",
                      "lineHeight": 1.43,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "K9VRv",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$mutedFg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Agent 报 Completed → 留在「进行中」并标绿「待确认」，点「确认」归档进「已完成」。\n• 人工直接去终端或面板追问 → 收到 Running 后自动清除「待确认」。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "L1SXq8",
                  "name": "Note / Worktree 共享 & kumu todo CLI",
                  "width": "fill_container",
