                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$mutedFg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 根仓库与 Worktree 共享同一看板（Worktree 下标题提示「· 共享自 kumu」），新派发的 Agent 默认在当前选中的目录启动。\n• CLI：kumu todo list / add / show / update / review / done / remove（自动按 $KUMU_PANE 定位仓库）。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
